  "description": "PostgreSQL provider for ClrKernel: connect to PostgreSQL from C# notebook cells with the same fluent query API as the other providers — Postgres.Connect(host, port, database, user, \"secret:ref\").Query(sql).Results(). Built on Npgsql. Passwords are never written into a notebook or a config file; only a secret reference is, resolved from the OS credential store or CLRKERNEL_SECRET_*.",
